{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgfi8aYKQpFxDLDWbersS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The high-spin → low-spin crossover happens at **Dq ≈ 1.77 × 10³ cm⁻¹** (10Dq ≈ 17 700 cm⁻¹). The leading strong-field estimate is exact arithmetic (1 891 cm⁻¹); the configuration-interaction correction that brings it down to 1 770 cm⁻¹ is scaled from the published Tanabe–Sugano diagram, not calculated here. So treat the result as about ±30 cm⁻¹.\n\n**The two competing ground states**\n- High spin: ⁶A₁g from t₂g³e_g². Its energy is 10A − 35B, and it does not depend on Dq.\n- Low spin: ²T₂g from t₂g⁵. Its energy is 10A − 20B + 10C − 20Dq.\n\n**Strong-field (diagonal-only) estimate**\n\nSetting the two energies equal gives 20Dq = 15B + 10C, so Dq = 0.75B + 0.5C.\n\nWith B = 621 cm⁻¹ and C = 2 851 cm⁻¹ (C/B = 4.59):\n\nDq = 465.75 + 1 425.5 = **1 891 cm⁻¹** (Dq/B ≈ 3.05)\n\n**Correction for configuration interaction**\n\nThe ⁶A₁ state is the only sextet, so its energy is exact. The t₂g⁵ ²T₂ state, however, mixes with the ²T₂ states of the excited t₂g⁴e_g¹ configuration (and higher ones), which lowers its energy.\n\n- I did not diagonalise the full ²T₂ interaction matrix. I don't have its elements to hand and had no calculation tool in this session.\n- Instead I scaled from the Tanabe–Sugano d⁵ diagram, which was drawn for C/B = 4.477. On that diagram the crossover is at about Dq/B ≈ 2.8. The diagonal-only formula gives about 2.99 there, so the mixing lowers the ²T₂ state by roughly 3.8B near the crossover.\n- I assumed that correction stays about the same at C/B = 4.59.\n\nApplying it:\n\nDq ≈ (15B + 10C − 3.8B)/20 ≈ (9 315 + 28 510 − 2 360)/20 ≈ **1 770 cm⁻¹** (Dq/B ≈ 2.85)\n\nDiagonalising the full ²T₂ matrix would remove this uncertainty.\n\n{\"Dq\": 1770, \"B\": 621, \"C\": 2851, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"6A1/2T2 crossover: strong-field estimate 1891 cm^-1, lowered to ~1770 cm^-1 by a CI correction scaled from the Tanabe-Sugano diagram, not computed.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":166,"cache_read_input_tokens":627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":166,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"35588b1c-a352-493e-8877-d98232d96f30","uuid":"455ee976-f50f-4b43-8e8c-7041e5b8d773","timestamp":"2026-11-03T08:52:10.339Z","request_id":"req_011Cgfi8aCj8HswS7d1ohhkk"}
